# Competition Arena — phone layout

> **BUILT 9 October 2026. Code-complete, not committed. Never verified by eye** (the page is behind sign-in, and nobody has reviewed it on a real phone).
>
> **Where it lives:** `components/competitions/arena/mobile/`. Below `md`, `app/(root)/competitions/page-content.tsx` renders `MobileCompetitionsArena`. Desktop (`CompetitionsArena`, behind `hidden md:block`) is unchanged.
>
> | Reference part | Built as |
> |---|---|
> | Header: back button, "Competition Arena" with subtitle | `MobileArenaHeader`. The back button links to `/dashboard`; the title comes from the shared `splitArenaTitle` |
> | Server Time, Balance, Add Volts | Three compact `ArenaUtilityCard`s (the shared card with a new `compact` prop). Add Volts links to `/wallet` |
> | KPI strip with dots | `MobileArenaKpis`: one tile per screen, snap scrolling, and dots you can tap. Live and Starting Soon set the status filter |
> | Search, then chips | `MobileArenaFilters`: native selects on an opaque background (R60) for Game, Assets (trading only), Difficulty, Sort and Status, plus a Clear button |
> | One card per row: 3:4 cover on the left; status and countdown, title, description and metrics on the right; Host and the button at the bottom | `MobileCompetitionCard`, built from the shared parts (`CardHero`, frame, ribbons, `CompetitionCTA`, `CompetitionStatusBadge`, `useCountdownDisplay`). Each metric shows its value beside its label, with at most six |
> | "Loading more competitions... Automatically loads 10 more items" | `MobileArenaInfiniteList`: an IntersectionObserver sentinel feeds `useMobileArenaPages`, ten items per page. It also has loading skeletons, an empty state, and a retry button on the error states |
>
> **Rules kept:**
> - The phone tree never imports `ArenaCompetitionCard`, `ArenaCompetitionListRow` or `ArenaPagination`.
> - Both trees build their cards with one presentation helper (`arena-shared.ts`).
> - The pages the phone appends never reach the desktop list.
>
> **Not built:** a grid/list toggle on the phone (deliberate).
>
> **Guarded by:** `__tests__/competitions/competition-arena-mobile.test.ts`.

## Brief

Rebuild `/competitions` on phones (360–430px) to match the owner's Mobile UI Guide image. Follow `.cursor/rules/player-mobile-ui.mdc`:
- give the phone its own tree below `md`;
- use the same data, filters and routes as desktop;
- share identity chrome rather than forking it;
- respect safe areas.
